{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-luk-22-1","title":"Luke 22:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The Jews conspire against Christ. 3 Satan prepares Judas to betray him. 7 The apostles prepare the passover. 19 Christ institutes his holy supper; 21 covertly foretells of the traitor; 24 rebukes the rest of his apostles from ambition; 31 assures Peter his faith should not fail; 34 and yet he should deny him thrice. 39 He prays in the mount, and sweats blood; 47 is betrayed with a kiss; 50 he heals Malchus' ear; 54 he is thrice denied of Peter; 63 shamefully abused; 66 and confesses himself to be the Son of God.</p>\n<p>Ex 12:6-23; Le 23:5,6; Mt 26:2; Mr 14:1,2,12; Joh 11:55-57 1Co 5:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-2","title":"Luke 22:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>19:47,48; 20:19; Ps 2:1-5; Mt 21:38,45,46; 26:3-5; Joh 11:47-53,57 Ac 4:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-3","title":"Luke 22:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>entered. Mt 26:14; Mr 14:10,11; Joh 6:70,71; 12:6; 13:2,27; Ac 5:3 being. 21; 6:16; Ps 41:9; 55:12-14; Mt 26:23; Mr 14:18-20; Joh 13:18,26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-4","title":"Luke 22:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>went. Mt 26:14; Mr 14:10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-5","title":"Luke 22:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>and covenanted. Zec 11:12,13; Mt 26:15-16; 27:3-5; Ac 1:18; 8:20; 1Ti 6:9,10 2Pe 2:3,15; Jude 1:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-6","title":"Luke 22:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>in the absence of the multitude. or, without tumult. Mt 26:5; Mr 14:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-7","title":"Luke 22:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>1; Ex 12:6,18; Mt 26:17; Mr 14:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-8","title":"Luke 22:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>he. Mr 14:13-16 Go. 1:6; Mt 3:15; Ga 4:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-10","title":"Luke 22:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>19:29-40; 1Sa 10:2-7; Mt 26:18,19; Joh 16:4; Ac 8:26-29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-11","title":"Luke 22:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>The Master. 19:31,34; Mt 21:3; Joh 11:28 Where is. 19:5; Re 3:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-12","title":"Luke 22:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>he. Joh 2:25; 21:17; Ac 16:14,15 a large. Ac 1:13; 20:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-13","title":"Luke 22:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>21:33; Joh 2:5; 11:40; Heb 11:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-14","title":"Luke 22:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>De 16:6,7; Mt 26:20; Mr 14:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-15","title":"Luke 22:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>With desire I have desired. or, I have heartily desired. 12:50; Joh 4:34; 13:1; 17:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-16","title":"Luke 22:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>I will not. 18-20 until. 30; 12:37; 14:15; Joh 6:27,50-58; Ac 10:41; 1Co 5:7,8; Heb 10:1-10 Re 19:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-17","title":"Luke 22:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>took. Ps 23:5; 116:13; Jer 16:7 gave. 19; 9:16; De 8:10; 1Sa 9:13; Ro 14:6; 1Ti 4:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-18","title":"Luke 22:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>I will not. 16; Mt 26:29; Mr 14:23; 15:23 the fruit. Jud 9:13; Ps 104:15; Pr 31:6,7; So 5:1; Isa 24:9-11; 25:6; 55:1 Zec 9:15,17; Eph 5:18,19 until. 9:27; 21:31; Da 2:44; Mt 16:18; Mr 9:1; Ac 2:30-36; Col 1:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-19","title":"Luke 22:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>he took. Mt 26:26-28; Mr 14:22-24; 1Co 10:16; 11:23-29 gave thanks. 17; 24:30; Joh 6:23; 1Th 5:18 is my. 20; Ge 41:26,27; Eze 37:11; Da 2:38; 4:22-24; Zec 5:7,8; 1Co 10:4 Ga 4:25 given. Joh 6:51; Ga 1:4; Eph 5:2; Tit 2:14; 1Pe 2:24 this do. Ps 78:4-6; 111:4; So 1:4; 1Co 11:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-20","title":"Luke 22:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>This. Ex 24:8; Zec 9:11; 1Co 10:16-21; 11:25; Heb 8:6-13; 9:17; 12:24 Heb 13:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-21","title":"Luke 22:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Job 19:19; Ps 41:9; Mic 7:5,6; Mt 26:21-23; Mr 14:18 Joh 13:18,19,21,26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-22","title":"Luke 22:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>truly. 24:25-27,46; Ge 3:15; Ps 22:1-31; 69:1-36; Isa 53:1-12; Da 9:24-26 Zec 13:7; Mt 26:24,53,54; Mr 14:21; Ac 2:23; 4:25-28; 13:27,28 Ac 26:22,23; 1Co 15:3,4; 1Pe 1:11 but. Ps 55:12-15; 69:22-28; 109:6-15; Mt 27:5; Joh 17:12; Ac 1:16-25 2Pe 2:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-23","title":"Luke 22:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Mt 26:22; Mr 14:19; Joh 13:22-25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-24","title":"Luke 22:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>9:46; Mt 20:20-24; Mr 9:34; 10:37-41; Ro 12:10; 1Co 13:4; Php 2:3-5 Jas 4:5,6; 1Pe 5:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-25","title":"Luke 22:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>Mt 20:25-28; Mr 10:41-45</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-26","title":"Luke 22:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>9:48; Mt 18:3-5; 23:8-12; Ro 12:2; 1Pe 5:3; 3Jo 1:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-27","title":"Luke 22:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>12:37; 17:7-9; Mt 20:28; Joh 13:5-16; 2Co 8:9; Php 2:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-28","title":"Luke 22:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>Mt 19:28,29; 24:13; Joh 6:67,68; 8:31; Ac 1:25; Heb 2:18; 4:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-29","title":"Luke 22:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>12:32; 19:17; Mt 24:47; 25:34; 1Co 9:25; 2Co 1:7; 2Ti 2:12; Jas 2:5 1Pe 5:4; Re 21:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-30","title":"Luke 22:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>eat. 16-18; 12:37; 14:15; 2Sa 9:9,10; 19:28; Mt 8:11; Re 19:9 and sit. Ps 49:14; Mt 19:28; 1Co 6:2,3; Re 2:26,27; 3:21; 4:4; *Gr:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-31","title":"Luke 22:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>Simon. 10:41; Ac 9:4 Satan. Job 1:8-11; 2:3-6; Zec 3:1; 1Pe 5:8; Re 12:10 sift. Am 9:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-32","title":"Luke 22:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>I have. Zec 3:2-4; Joh 14:19; 17:9-11,15-21; Ro 5:9,10; 8:32,34; Heb 7:25 1Pe 1:5; 1Jo 2:1,2 thy faith. 8:13; 2Ti 2:18; Tit 1:1; Heb 12:15; 1Pe 1:1; 1Jo 2:19 and when. 61,62; Mt 18:3; 26:75; Mr 14:72; 16:7; Ac 3:19 strengthen. Ps 32:3-6; 51:12,13; Joh 21:15-17; 2Co 1:4-6; 1Ti 1:13-16 Heb 12:12,13; 1Pe 1:13; 5:8-10; 2Pe 1:10-12; 3:14,17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-33","title":"Luke 22:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>I am. 2Ki 8:12,13; Pr 28:26; Jer 10:23; 17:9; Mt 20:22; 26:33-35,40,41 Mr 14:29,31,37,38; Joh 13:36,37; Ac 20:23,24; 21:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-34","title":"Luke 22:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>the cock. Mt 26:34,74; Mr 14:30,71,72; Joh 13:38; 18:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-35","title":"Luke 22:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>When. 9:3; 10:4; Mt 10:9,10; Mr 6:8,9 lacked. 12:29-31; Ge 48:15; De 8:2,3,16; Ps 23:1; 34:9,10; 37:3; Mt 6:31-33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-36","title":"Luke 22:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>But. Mt 10:22-25; Joh 15:20; 16:33; 1Th 2:14,15; 3:4; 1Pe 4:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-37","title":"Luke 22:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>this. 22; 18:31; 24:44-46; Mt 26:54-56; Joh 10:35; 19:28-30; Ac 13:27-29 And he. 23:32; Isa 53:12; Mr 15:27,28; 2Co 5:21; Ga 3:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-38","title":"Luke 22:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>It. Mt 26:52-54; Joh 18:36; 2Co 10:3,4; Eph 6:10-18; 1Th 5:8; 1Pe 5:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-39","title":"Luke 22:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>he came. Mt 26:36-38; Mr 14:32-34; Joh 18:1,2 as. 21:37; Mr 11:11,19; 13:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-40","title":"Luke 22:40","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":40,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":40},"content":"<p>Pray. 46; 11:4; 1Ch 4:10; Ps 17:5; 19:13; 119:116,117,133; Pr 30:8,9 Mt 6:13; 26:41; Mr 14:38; 2Co 12:7-10; Eph 6:18,19; 1Pe 4:7; 5:8,9 Re 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-41","title":"Luke 22:41","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":41,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":41},"content":"<p>and kneeled. Mt 26:39; Mr 14:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-42","title":"Luke 22:42","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":42,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":42},"content":"<p>Father. Mt 26:42,44; Mr 14:36; Joh 12:27,28 willing, remove. Gr. willing to remove. cup. 17-20; Isa 51:17,22; Jer 25:15; Mt 20:22; Joh 18:11 not. Ps 40:8; Joh 4:34; 5:30; 6:38; Heb 10:7-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-43","title":"Luke 22:43","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":43,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":43},"content":"<p>an. 4:10,11; Ps 91:11,12; Mt 4:6,11; 26:53; 1Ti 3:16; Heb 1:6,14 strengthening. 32; De 3:28; Job 4:3,4; Da 10:16-19; 11:1; Ac 18:23; Heb 2:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-44","title":"Luke 22:44","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":44,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":44},"content":"<p>being. Ge 32:24-28; Ps 22:1,2,12-21; 40:1-3; 69:14-18; 88:1-18; 130:1,2 Ps 143:6,7; La 1:12; 3:53-56; Jon 2:2,3; Joh 12:27; Heb 5:7 his. Isa 53:10; La 1:12; Ro 8:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-45","title":"Luke 22:45","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":45,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":45},"content":"<p>sleeping. Mt 26:40,43; Mr 14:37,40,41</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-46","title":"Luke 22:46","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":46,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":46},"content":"<p>Why sleep ye. 40; 21:34-36; Pr 6:4-11; Jon 1:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-47","title":"Luke 22:47","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":47,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":47},"content":"<p>while. Mt 26:45-47; Mr 14:41-43; Joh 18:2-9 Judas. 3-6; Mt 26:14-16,47; Mr 14:10,43; Ac 1:16-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-48","title":"Luke 22:48","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":48,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":48},"content":"<p>betrayest. 2Sa 20:9,10; Ps 55:21; Pr 27:6; Mt 26:48-50; Mr 14:44-46</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-50","title":"Luke 22:50","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":50,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":50},"content":"<p>Mt 26:51-54; Mr 14:47; Joh 18:10,11; Ro 12:19; 2Co 10:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-51","title":"Luke 22:51","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":51,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":51},"content":"<p>Suffer. Joh 17:12; 18:8,9 And he. Ro 12:21; 2Co 10:1; 1Pe 2:21-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-52","title":"Luke 22:52","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":52,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":52},"content":"<p>Jesus. Mt 26:55; Mr 14:48,49 captains. 4; 2Ki 11:15; Joh 17:12; Ac 5:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-53","title":"Luke 22:53","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":53,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":53},"content":"<p>I was. 21:37,38; Mt 21:12-15,23,45,46; Joh 7:25,26,30,45 but. Jud 16:21-30; Job 20:5; Joh 12:27; 16:20-22 the power. Joh 14:30; Ac 26:18; 2Co 4:3-6; Eph 6:12; Col 1:13; Re 12:9-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-54","title":"Luke 22:54","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":54,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":54},"content":"<p>took.Our blessed Lord before his death passed another examination. One was before the Jewish Sanhedrim, whose proper province it was to try such as were accused as false prophets or blasphemers. This was a kind of ecclesiastical court. The other, with which the next chapter opens, was before Pilate, the Roman governor of Judea at that time; he principally took cognizance of criminal things, such especially as concerned the peace of the country, considered as part of the Roman empire.</p>\n<p>Mt 26:57,58; Mr 14:53,54; Joh 18:12-17,24 And Peter. 33,34; 2Ch 32:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-55","title":"Luke 22:55","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":55,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":55},"content":"<p>had. 44; Mt 26:69; Mr 14:66; Joh 18:17,18 Peter. Ps 1:1; 26:4,5; 28:3; Pr 9:6; 13:20; 1Co 15:33; 2Co 6:15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-56","title":"Luke 22:56","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":56,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":56},"content":"<p>a certain maid. Mt 26:69; Mr 14:6,17,66-68; Joh 18:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-57","title":"Luke 22:57","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":57,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":57},"content":"<p>he denied. 33,34; 12:9; Mt 10:33; 26:70; Joh 18:25,27; Ac 3:13,14,19 2Ti 2:10-12; 1Jo 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-58","title":"Luke 22:58","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":58,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":58},"content":"<p>another.A maid challenged Peter in the second instance, according to Matthew and Mark; yet here it is said [heteros ,] another (man) and he also answers to a man. But [heteros ,] as Wetstein shows, may be, and is in innumerable instances applied to a female; and Matthew says, \"she said to them that were there,\" and Mark, \"she began to say to them that stood by.\" So that the maid gave the information to those around her, and some man charged Peter with it. Probably several joined in the accusation, though he answered to an individual, for John says, \"They said unto him,\" etc.</p>\n<p>Mt 26:71,72; Mr 14:69,70; Joh 18:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-59","title":"Luke 22:59","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":59,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":59},"content":"<p>confidently. Mt 26:73,74; Mr 14:69,70; Joh 18:26,27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-60","title":"Luke 22:60","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":60,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":60},"content":"<p>the cock. 34; Mt 26:74,75; Mr 14:71,72; Joh 18:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-61","title":"Luke 22:61","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":61,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":61},"content":"<p>turned. 10:41; Mr 5:30 looked. Job 33:27; Isa 57:15-18; Jer 31:18-20; Ho 11:8; Ac 5:31 And Peter. Eze 16:63; 36:31,32; Eph 2:11; Re 2:5 Before. 34; Mt 26:34,75; Joh 13:38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-62","title":"Luke 22:62","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":62,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":62},"content":"<p>and wept. Ps 38:18; 126:5,6; 130:1-4; 143:1-4; Jer 31:18; Eze 7:16; Zec 12:10 Mt 5:4; 26:75; Mr 14:72; 1Co 10:12; 2Co 7:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-63","title":"Luke 22:63","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":63,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":63},"content":"<p>the men. Mt 26:59-68; Mr 14:55-65; Joh 18:22 mocked. Job 16:9,10; 30:9-14; Ps 22:6,7,13; 35:15,16,25; 69:7-12; Isa 49:7 Isa 50:6,7; 52:14; 53:3; Mic 5:1; Mt 27:28-31,39-44; Mr 15:16-20 Mr 15:27-32; Heb 12:2; 1Pe 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-64","title":"Luke 22:64","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":64,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":64},"content":"<p>blindfolded. Jud 16:21,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-65","title":"Luke 22:65","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":65,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":65},"content":"<p>blasphemously. 12:10; Mt 12:31,32; Ac 26:11; 1Ti 1:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-66","title":"Luke 22:66","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":66,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":66},"content":"<p>as soon. Mt 27:1; Mr 15:1 elders. Ps 2:1-3; Ac 4:25-28; 22:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-67","title":"Luke 22:67","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":67,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":67},"content":"<p>Art. Mt 11:3-5; 26:63-68; Mr 14:61-66; Joh 10:24 If. 16:31; Joh 5:39-47; 8:43-45; 9:27,28; 10:25,26; 12:37-43</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-68","title":"Luke 22:68","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":68,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":68},"content":"<p>20:3-7,41-44</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-69","title":"Luke 22:69","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":69,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":69},"content":"<p>shall. Mt 26:64; Mr 14:62 on. Ps 110:1; Da 7:13,14; Mt 22:44; Mr 16:19; Ac 2:34-36; 7:55,56 Ro 8:34; Eph 1:20-23; 4:8-10; Col 3:1; Heb 1:3; 8:1; 12:2; 1Pe 3:22 Re 3:21; 22:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-70","title":"Luke 22:70","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":70,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":70},"content":"<p>the Son. 4:41; Ps 2:7,12; Mt 3:17; 27:43,54; Joh 1:34,49; 10:30,36; 19:7 Ye say. 23:3; Mt 26:64; Mr 14:62; 15:2; Joh 18:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-22-71","title":"Luke 22:71","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":71,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":71},"content":"<p>Mt 26:65,66; Mr 14:63,64</p>"}]}